{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091811285029761091","created_at":"2026-08-24T08:54:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091811285029761091"],"id":"2091811285029761091","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":1768,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"你驾驭不住的东西才会显相。情绪驾驭不住则怒气挂相，财富驾驭不住则铜臭外露，权力驾驭不住则盛气凌人。所以真正的贵人没有骄奢气，真正的高手也没有刀剑气，真正的美人更没有造作姿。所谓大象无形，大音希声，只因其内在已全然驾驭，故外在便会返璞归真，不留痕迹。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091811285029761091"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091802939006574857","created_at":"2026-08-24T08:20:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091802939006574857"],"id":"2091802939006574857","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":82,"impression_count":18377,"like_count":366,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":37},"text":"什么是正缘？\n不是出轨的那个，也不是结婚的那个。真正的正缘，是你在一个人也能活得很好之后，才遇见的。\n而那个让你神魂颠倒、患得患失、以为非他不可的人——不是来渡你的，是来收你的。他会把你的心碾碎，让你掉半条命，然后让你一个人爬起来。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091802939006574857"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091774043573948533","created_at":"2026-08-24T06:26:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091774043573948533"],"id":"2091774043573948533","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":34262,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"关于宇树科技吧，上周的分享。 https://t.co/18hYl3baoK","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091774043573948533"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091767615446495237","created_at":"2026-08-24T06:00:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091767615446495237"],"id":"2091767615446495237","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2034,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2089538577453740487","type":"quoted"}],"text":"厄尔尼诺，是在上上周布局吧，上周收获，结果今天看到很多群在推种业股，当然这波不一定结束，但每每看到这么马后炮，就觉得很有意思，这也是我为啥会关注很多号，更多时候是为了拿来作对照和反向指标！\n也算是量化系统处理散户情绪数据的一环！ https://t.co/YRMGYomxBB","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091767615446495237"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091758786470187067","created_at":"2026-08-24T05:25:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091758786470187067"],"id":"2091758786470187067","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3980,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2091480533280882934","type":"quoted"}],"text":"市场上最近炒作就是美债，长债厉害贵金属，短债利好加密货币！ https://t.co/08FPxFeFsn","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091758786470187067"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091756437206872166","created_at":"2026-08-24T05:16:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091756437206872166"],"id":"2091756437206872166","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2171,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"当你不知道买啥时，休息是最好的操作，当然上周我们进了加密货币避险！ https://t.co/s36RZUG2NM","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091756437206872166"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091750317235065288","created_at":"2026-08-24T04:51:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091750317235065288"],"id":"2091750317235065288","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2274,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2091749307418571094","type":"quoted"}],"text":"之前收过的sub要么QS前200博士，要么某公司高管，有魅力吸引的才能让你持续上头，不断经营这段关系！ https://t.co/pdKK9LZY2U","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091750317235065288"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091748791552753687","created_at":"2026-08-24T04:45:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091748791552753687"],"id":"2091748791552753687","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":3110,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"有魅力的人都鬼鬼的\n优秀和有魅力、是两回事。优秀就是简单、直接、阳光，做朋友很不错。而有魅力的人，天生会给人一种虐感、一种坏的感觉，还有一点阴。所以“魅力”的“魅”为什么是鬼字旁，因为有魅力的人，都鬼鬼的。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091748791552753687"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091564844638179544","created_at":"2026-08-23T16:34:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091564844638179544"],"id":"2091564844638179544","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2665,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2091310766863618174","type":"quoted"}],"text":"尊重每一只青蛙，和它的那口井 。你能看见天，是你的幸运；它守着井，是它的安稳。不评判，不拯救，不俯视，真正的温柔，是理解不同的存在方式。\n#dom #sub #调教 #管制 #男尊女卑 https://t.co/7f918GNdyW","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091564844638179544"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091539643468755124","created_at":"2026-08-23T14:54:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091539643468755124"],"id":"2091539643468755124","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1407,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"幸福的第一原理是内在秩序。所有的顶级玩家最后追求的都是——运动、自然、长期主义、稳定关系和低刺激生活。\n运动，是身体的秩序。自然，是心灵的秩序。长期主义，是时间的秩序。稳定关系，是情感的秩序。低刺激生活，是欲望的秩序。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091539643468755124"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091514252343533957","created_at":"2026-08-23T13:13:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091514252343533957"],"id":"2091514252343533957","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1612,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"都想成为这样帅的男人吧！ https://t.co/HuONKSYkhb","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091514252343533957"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091480533280882934","created_at":"2026-08-23T10:59:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091480533280882934"],"id":"2091480533280882934","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7375,"like_count":25,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"利用稳定币的刚性需求来消化短期国债→通过债务置换缓解长端利率压力→长端利率稳定利好科技股估值→市场流动性预期改善助推比特币等风险资产。\n这条路径半个月后看看能否验证！ https://t.co/tJwc0NFhXN","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091480533280882934"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091417904319492596","created_at":"2026-08-23T06:50:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091417904319492596"],"id":"2091417904319492596","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":15325,"like_count":64,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":7},"text":"中国有过三代A股得道大神，这里指是完整构建体系，并非单纯凭借信息差，很多的股神是信息差导致，这部分群体基本是皇亲国戚。\n三代大神分别是缠中说禅、徐翔、无锡清扬路，其中徐翔是高中生出道，李彪和无锡清扬路都是高材生。\n市场上关于李彪和徐翔的东西挺多，无锡清扬路的挺少，而他才是这里面真神","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091417904319492596"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091414701674836414","created_at":"2026-08-23T06:38:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091414701674836414"],"id":"2091414701674836414","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":2594,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"李彪的交易哲学与亿安科技操盘实战\n\n1️⃣ 交易本质认知  \n关键词：心态＞技术  \n核心总结：交易失败源于看不懂自己而非看不懂图。李彪通过闭关研究禅宗、打坐，认识到必须解决贪婪、恐惧、侥幸等情感问题，才能真正理解市场走势规律。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091414701674836414"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091371590986735813","created_at":"2026-08-23T03:46:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091371590986735813"],"id":"2091371590986735813","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1582,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"浅谈，《欢迎来龙餐馆》\n\n这几天，电影《欢迎来龙餐馆》刷屏了。上映短短十一天时间，票房已经突破十三亿。\n\n影片中在战争面前，所有体面都被撕碎，在生死的抉择中，人性里的曲折幽微，也变得纤毫毕现。\n\n当一个人觉得我比你高级，我比你更有权去评价一个人，一件东西的时候，人就会变得狭隘、自负。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091371590986735813"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091326343678177390","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:47:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091326343678177390"],"id":"2091326343678177390","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1157,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"补偿心理的本质，是用新的交易去治疗旧的情绪伤口。市场不会因为你的不甘心而回头，它只会奖励那些能接受“错过”并继续按规则行动的人。\n真正的交易成熟，往往体现在：看到行情启动却没上车时，能平静地说“这波与我无关”，然后等待下一个符合自己系统的机会。能做到这一点的人，才真正跨过了“心态关”。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091326343678177390"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091324177194364994","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:38:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091324177194364994"],"id":"2091324177194364994","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2036,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2090374835931410807","type":"quoted"}],"text":"补偿心理（Compensatory Psychology）与交易行为是行为金融学中极具破坏力的一种模式，尤其在行情启动初期或踏空后表现得尤为明显。\n一、什么是补偿心理\n补偿心理本质是：当现实结果与自己的预期/自我形象严重偏离时，人会用一种“反向行动”来试图平衡内心的失衡感。 https://t.co/YzZI0Y1I3w","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091324177194364994"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091320188721676590","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:22:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091320188721676590"],"id":"2091320188721676590","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2768,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2090374835931410807","type":"quoted"}],"text":"其实我在以太坊刚突破4000点时，问到现在做多的多还是做空的多，就是很清楚交易者的补偿心理也是D/M中的一种。\n我一直在说的做好交易，你必须同时掌握基础学科和搞懂人性，而偏Sub向的补偿心理，就是投资者人性中重要的一环！ https://t.co/YzZI0Y1I3w","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091320188721676590"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091318214030749731","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:14:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091318214030749731"],"id":"2091318214030749731","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":6169,"like_count":10,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"如何成为1个真正的Dom，而不是伪Dom！\n之前混圈的时候我们都是线下，通过各种活动组织进来，那会没那么龙蛇混杂。\n后来推特的兴起，导致了大量伪Dom的崛起，从而把这个圈子搞的乌烟瘴气，这些年我看到了不下100个生病的sub，希望后面进圈的人